    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00001",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00095:alt:fig-00001-alt",
          "text": "A reaction shows the epoxidation of cycloheptene with meta-chloroperoxybenzoic acid in dichloromethane to form epoxycycloheptane and meta-chlorobenzoic acid"
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_08_07_001.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "id": "para-00004",
      "segmentId": "m00095:para:para-00004"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00002",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00095:alt:fig-00002-alt",
          "text": "A reaction mechanism shows alkene reacting with peroxyacid to form epoxide and acid."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_08_07_002.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "id": "para-00005",
      "segmentId": "m00095:para:para-00005"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00003",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00095:alt:fig-00003-alt",
          "text": "Cyclohexene reacts with chlorine in the presence of water to form trans-2-chloro-cyclohexanol, which reacts with aqueous sodium hydroxide to form 1,2-epoxycyclohexane (73 percent yield), water, and sodium chloride."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_08_07_003.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "id": "para-00006",
      "segmentId": "m00095:para:para-00006"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00004",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00095:alt:fig-00004-alt",
          "text": "An alkene undergoes epoxidation to form an epoxide, which reacts with hydronium ion to form a 1,2-diol product."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_08_07_004.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "id": "para-00007",
      "segmentId": "m00095:para:para-00007"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00005",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00095:alt:fig-00005-alt",
          "text": "A reaction mechanism shows 1,2-epoxycyclohexane reacting with hydronium ion and water to form trans-1,2-cyclohexanediol (86 percent yield). At the bottom, cyclohexene reacts with bromine to form trans-1,2-dibromocyclohexane."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_08_07_005.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "id": "para-00008",
      "segmentId": "m00095:para:para-00008"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00006",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00095:alt:fig-00006-alt",
          "text": "1,2-Dimethylcyclopentene reacts with osmium tetroxide in pyridine to form a cyclic osmate intermediate, which reacts with N a H S O 3 in water to form cis-1,2-dimethyl-1,2-cyclopentanediol (87 percent yield)."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_08_07_006.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "id": "para-00009",
      "segmentId": "m00095:para:para-00009"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig-00007",
      "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
      "caption": null,
      "media": {
        "alt": {
          "segmentId": "m00095:alt:fig-00007-alt",
          "text": "1-Phenyl-cyclohexene reacts with catalytic osmium tetroxide in the presence of acetone and water, followed by  N-methylmorpholine N-oxide reduction to form cis-1-phenyl-1,2-cyclohexanediol (93 percent yield), osmium tetroxide, and N-methyl-morpholine."
        },
        "src": "../../media/OChem_08_07_007.jpg",
        "mimeType": "image/jpeg"
      }
    },
